WEBVTT

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:05.240
I called four pool companies this week. Four.

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:08.540
Voicemail, and ring, ring —
and nobody calls me back.

00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:19.300
Three messages since Tuesday. My kitchen's flooding,
and not one of them has called me back.

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:27.080
Three days with no AC in this heat.
I keep calling the company, and

00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:29.080
I get his voicemail.
Nobody ever calls back.

00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:33.200
That's exactly why we exist at AiHiddenLeads.

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:39.240
We answer every call for your business, 24 hours a day,
instantly — so you never miss another lead.

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:43.260
I'm Ron Melo. I created AiHiddenLeads

00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:49.360
because good businesses were losing customers
to phones that just ring and ring, and nobody calls back.

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:55.420
So Aspen answers every call — on your website
or on your phone, day or night —

00:00:55.420 --> 00:00:58.720
and real leads come straight to you, warm-transferred.

00:00:58.720 --> 00:01:07.060
Call 877-86-AIWIZ — that's 862-4949 —

00:01:07.060 --> 00:01:10.100
or visit aihiddenleads.com.
